            <ArticleTitle>[Gas chromatography analysis of lipids in cell culture in viral infections and in serum of patients with various pathological conditions].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>5-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The results of gas chromatographic analysis of fatty acid composition of cell cultures infected with Coxsackie B viruses (CBV) and of sera of patients with unstable angina, psoriasis, and after stroke indicate that the presence of CBV in the organism can be one of the causes of lipid dysmetabolism.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
